# Title: HackTool - SharpUp PrivEsc Tool Execution
# ID: c484e533-ee16-4a93-b6ac-f0ea4868b2f1
# Status: test
# Level: critical
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-08-20
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.discovery, attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1615, attack.t1569.002, attack.t1574.005
# Description: Detects the use of SharpUp, a tool for local privilege escalation
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_path="*\\SharpUp.exe") OR (Description="SharpUp") OR ((process_exec="*HijackablePaths*" OR process_exec="*UnquotedServicePath*" OR process_exec="*ProcessDLLHijack*" OR process_exec="*ModifiableServiceBinaries*" OR process_exec="*ModifiableScheduledTask*" OR process_exec="*DomainGPPPassword*" OR process_exec="*CachedGPPPassword*")))
